# 📚 TOEIC Vocabulary - Day19

| Word | Meaning | Example |
|---|---|---|
| announce | 발표하다 | The company announced a new policy. |
| postpone | 연기하다 | The meeting was postponed. |
| attend | 참석하다 | All employees must attend the meeting. |
| arrange | 준비하다, 마련하다 | We arranged a meeting with the client. |
| notify | 알리다 | Please notify us of any changes. |

